<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32x32.png"/><title>Lessons from Lars | Federal Reserve Bank of Minneapolis</title><meta name="title" content="Lessons from Lars | Federal Reserve Bank of Minneapolis"/><meta name="description" content=""/><meta name="ess:pagetype" content="Speech"/><meta name="ess:publishdatetime" content="2013-12-04T02:00:00Z"/><meta name="sortDate" content="2013-12-04T02:00:00Z"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta property="og:url" content="/speeches/2013/lessons-from-lars"/><meta property="og:title" content="Lessons from Lars | Federal Reserve Bank of Minneapolis"/><meta name="og:description" content=""/><meta property="og:image" content="/-/media/images/stock/president/kocherlakota/speaking/kocherlakota-narayana-speaking-opta-2col.jpg?rev=09fe8e4e88894e1a980a4a0b5a8c1c12"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Lessons from Lars | Federal Reserve Bank of Minneapolis"/><meta name="twitter:description" content=""/><meta name="twitter:url" content="/speeches/2013/lessons-from-lars"/><meta name="twitter:image" content="/-/media/images/stock/president/kocherlakota/speaking/kocherlakota-narayana-speaking-opta-2col.jpg?rev=09fe8e4e88894e1a980a4a0b5a8c1c12?sc_lang=en"/><meta name="next-head-count" content="19"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/ba589f78dbc8687a-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/5f5027ccbe3e5871-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/e77288c387d37b79-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/5db7d341bde4960f-s.p.woff2" as="